      "properties": {
        "char_end": 327,
        "char_start": 198,
        "episode_id": "77ae2478-6495-5707-a35f-04ab67e5386a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "This episode is brought to you by Datadog \u2014 unified observability across logs, metrics, and traces. Start at datadog.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:cd51a531de894fd8",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 423,
        "char_start": 327,
        "episode_id": "77ae2478-6495-5707-a35f-04ab67e5386a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "We opened the phones this week. Here's a question that came in from a listener out in the field.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-03",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Caller"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:36be965f877cb5b0",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 494,
        "char_start": 432,
        "episode_id": "77ae2478-6495-5707-a35f-04ab67e5386a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-03",
        "text": "Hi Ethan \u2014 how do you tell alert fatigue from a real incident?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:4c93af95a0f1ca28",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 656,
        "char_start": 507,
        "episode_id": "77ae2478-6495-5707-a35f-04ab67e5386a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Great question. Alert fatigue is a signal-to-noise problem, not a discipline problem. If the team ignores pages, the pages are wrong, not the people.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:06e12725205f2d7c",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 716,
        "char_start": 664,
        "episode_id": "77ae2478-6495-5707-a35f-04ab67e5386a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "So you'd tune the alerts before you tune the humans.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
